      "title": "C major scale",
      "body": "A major scale is named after its first note. The one that starts on C is the **C major scale**: C D E F G A B C, all white keys.\n\n**Why it matters:** It is the only major scale with no black keys, so it is the easiest one to see, and every other scale is compared with it.",
